{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即第十輪王，亦名鼓摩、鬱摩"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "日照、日聯、日調伏象。第四日尼樓，華言莊嚴，即淨飯所承也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "輯與集同，謂諸書總要"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即禮、樂、射、御、書、數也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "異生舊名凡夫"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦云羅閱祗伽羅，此云王舍城也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見譯成一百卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "衛大夫寗俞。武，諡也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "落戈切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此喻顯也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "真識也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "現識也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "分別事識也。已上法說也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "集解云：味體非樂，能生人樂也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一、衣染塵垢，二、花鬘萎顇，三、兩腋汗出，四、臭氣入身，五、不樂本座"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "滅法經九年，後至宋元嘉四年，被後\n魏太武併之也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "滅法經五年，帝崩，天元皇帝立，改元大成，復興焉。當陳大\n建十一年己亥。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音除"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即是佛也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即聞佛名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音支"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一本云"}
